Kiq
$cards
DECK 8 SPADES

$initial
DRAW 63 ROTATE 3 U 2
COLUMN 0 FACE_ALL
COLUMN 2 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 5 FACE_LAST
COLUMN 2 FACE_LAST

ELAIS 2 FACE_ALL
ELAIS 2 FACE_ALL
ELAIS 7 FACE_ALL
ELAIS 7 FACE_ALL
ELAIS 10 FACE_ALL
ELAIS 3 FACE_ALL
ELAIS 1 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE {ELAIS, DRAW, COLUMN} ELAIS
OR
    DEST Size < 7
    AND
        SRC Suit {SPADES, CLUBS, DIAMONDS, HEARTS}
        DEST Rank K
MOVE_STACK ELAIS {ELAIS, COLUMN}
SRC Suit {DIAMONDS, HEARTS, SPADES}
$win
AND
    OR
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
        PILE ALL COLUMN Empty
    PILE ALL DRAW Empty
